  "notes": "USAGE:\nA formal word for falling, used more in written language, news, and technical contexts than in daily conversation (where {落|お}ちる is more natural).\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- {自由|じゆう}{落下|らっか}: free fall\n- {落下物|らっかぶつ}: falling object\n- {落下|らっか}{傘|さん}: parachute\n- {落下|らっか}{地点|ちてん}: point of impact\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {落下|らっか}する: to fall, to drop\n- {落下|らっか}を{防|ふせ}ぐ: to prevent falling",
